    // The hard-set: up to N examples per cell.
    "hard": [
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Montevideo na cikin yankuna masu yanayin sauƙin zafi; a lokacin rani, zafi kan kai sama da +30°C." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Guguwar Fred ita ce guguwar teku mafi karfi da aka taba gani tun sanda aka fara amfani da tauraron Dan Adam, kuma guguwa ta uku wadda ake da bayananta da ta faru a gabashin 35°W." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "An kori Piquet Jr. bayan gasar Hungarian Grand Prix ta 2009." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "A 2010, yayinda na kasa, banki na yanzu Northern Rock plc an rusa shi daga ‘banki mummuna’, Northern Rock (gudanar da kadara)." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Daga baya shaida ta nuna cewa takaddun gwajin an jirkita su, tare da wasu jami’an ilimi 34 suma an tsoma su cikin laifin a shekarar 2013." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Duk da tsokacinsa ya ce zai goyi bayan abokan gasa na Britain a 2012 Olympics da ke gudana a birnin London." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Za a iya yin hakan karamar mota tare da matukar tsari na kulawa sosai amma 4/4 shi aka fi aminta da shi kuma wurare da dama sai da mota mai 4/4 za a iya shigarsu." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Ya kamata tsarin ya sami isasshen zurfi, 5 mm (inci 1/5) ko fiye, kuma kayan aikin su kasance masu taushi a yanayin sanyi." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Daidai ƙarfe 8:46 na safe, wani yanayin shuru ya faɗo ko'ina cikin birnin, yana alamar daidai lokacin kamar farkon bugawar manufan jirgin." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Kungiyar bincike na Iraq sun gabatar da rohotonsu da karfe 12.00 GMT a yau." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "An fara shirin da karfe 8:30 na yamma (15.00 UTC)." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Wajen 11:29, zanga-zangar ta koma Whitehall, gaba da dandalin Trafalgar, a wajajen teku, gittawa ta Aldwych kuma ta saman Kingsway zuwa Holborn inda jam'iyyar zaman dako ke gudanar da taron bazararsu a dakin otal ɗin Grand Connaught." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "An bai wa Batten matsayi na 190 a jerin sunayen Yan Amurka 400 mafi kudi a shekarar 2008 inda aka kiyasta dukiyarsa ta kai biliyan $2.3." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "CafeNet El Sol suna ba da sabis na ajiyar kuɗi don ƙimar US $ 30, ko $ 10 don wucewar kwana ɗaya; cikakkun bayanai akan shafin Corcovado." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Zanga-zangan ya fara ne misalin ƙarfe 11:00 agogon gida (UTC+1) akan Whitehall mai kallon tashar ‘yan sanda kofar shiga zuwa Layin Downing, Mazaunin Firam minister na hukuma." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Ana tsammanin yawancin tikiti na sha’ani za a sayar da su tsakanin ¥2,500 zuwa ¥130,000, yayin da tikiti na yau da kullun su ke kusan ¥ 7,000." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Kibiyoyinsu masu hadari da ake harbawa na iya fasa kariyar sojojin abokan gaba. Wajajen shekaru 1000 B.C.kafin zuwan annabi Musa yan Asiriya su ka kirkiri sojojin dawaki." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Kasar U.S. ta ce ta karba bayani daga tushe da ba a bayyana ba wadda musamman ta ambaci amfani da yan kunar bakin wake wajen fasa “sanannu wurare” a Ethiopia da Kenya." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Girgizan kasa ta bugi Mariana da karfe 07:19 na safe (09:19 p.m. GMT Juma’a)." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Northern Rock ya buƙaci tallafi saboda matsalar da ya shiga a lokacin ƙaramin rikicin bashin gina gida marar madafa a 2007." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Nasarorin da Vautier ta samu marasa alaka da bada umarni ba sun hada da yajin cin abinci a 1973 a kan abin da ya ke ganin dabaibayin siyasa ne." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Wasannin squash, karate da roller sun yi kokarin shiga cikin shirin Olympics haka kuma da wasannin kwallon hannu (baseball) da kwallon hannu mai laushi (softball) wadanda aka ƙi zaba cikin wasannin Olympics a 2005." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Rundunar samar da zaman lafiya na UN wadanda suka shiga kasar Haiti bayan girgizan kasa a shekarar 2010 na da alhakin yaduwar cutar wanda ya fara a gari kusa da masaukin rundunar." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Jirgin ya na tafiyar kimanin kilomita 12.8 ko mu ce mil 8 a kowace daƙiƙa, wato zai iya zuwa garin Los Angeles daga San Francisco a cikin minti guda." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Abu ne mai matuƙar wuyar sha’ani da ya haɗa da, bisa ga sassauƙan tsarin Bohr, na tsakiyar nucleus wanda electrons suka zagaye, ya yi kama da taurarin da ke kewaye da rana - duba Hoto na 1.1." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Sundarbans sun mamaye yanki mai faɗin 3,850 km², wanda kusan kashi ɗaya bisa ukunsa ruwa/ marsh ce." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Taínos da Caribes su suka fara zama a tsibirin. Caribes mutane ne masu magana da harshen Arawakan waɗanda suka isa kusan 10,000 BCE." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Tsibiran Cook ba su da wasu birane amma suna da tsibirai daban-daban har 15. Manyan cikinsu su ne Rarotonga da Aitutaki." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Gungun jellyfish na taruwa a kusa da rairayin bakin teku da kuma kusa da bakin kogi inda ya hadu da teku tsakanin watannin Oktoba zuwa Afrilu a arewacin 1770. Amma ana iya samunsu jefi jefi a wasu lokutan ma." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Kamfanonin tafiye-tafiye sun kasance tun karni na 19. Wakilin tafiye-tafiye galibi zaɓi ne mai kyau don tafiya wanda ya wuce abin da ya gabata na balaguro na ɗabi'a, al'ada, yare ko ƙasashe masu ƙarancin kuɗi." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Wandanda suka rasu sun hada da Nicholas Alden dan shekara 25, da Zachary Cuddeback mai shekara 21. Cuddeback ya kasance mai tukin." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Mutum mai nauyin fam 200 (90kg) a duniya zai yi kimanin fam 36 (16kg) a kan Io. Don haka nauyi, ba shakka, yana jan ƙasa akan ku." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Akwai nau'ikan yadda ake nadar fina-finai da yawa waɗanda aka yi amfani da su tsawon shekaru. Wanda aka fi amfani da shi shine mai kaurin 35 mm (36 by 24 mm)." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Mista Reid ya yi kokarin tuka Black Beauty, motar A1GP ta New Zealand, a gudu na sama da 160km / h ninki bakwai a bisa gadan." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Babbar Ƙoramar Amazon ta na da nisan 6,387 km (3,980 mil). Tana karbar ruwa daga dubban kananan ƙoramu." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Kasar Antarctica wanda ke nesa daga teku gari ne da babu kowa a ciki, kankara ya rufe mai nisan km 2-3 ya rufe shi." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "An sami kwarewar dabbobi masu tafiya da kafafu biyu a ƙasusuwan tarihi na Australopithecus daga shekaru miliyan 4.2-3.9 da suka shude, duk da cewa watakila Sahelanthropus sun yi tafiya da kafafu biyu tun wajen shekaru miliyan bakwai da suka gabata." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "A shekarar 1683, sojojin daular Qing (1644-1912) sun kwace ikon lardin Taiwan na yammacin da arewacin gabar teku, suka ayyana Taiwan a matsayin lardin daular Qing a shekarar 1885." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Ya ci ƙwallaye 2 da kuma 2 da ya taimaka aka ci a nasarar wasan Washington 5-3 akan Atlanta Thrashers." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Wasu daga cikin duwasun, wadanda samun su na da wuya a doran kasa, a siyar dasu tsakanin ukiya $11,000 zuwa $22,500 wanda haka ya ninka farashin zinari sau goma." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Dokar na bukatar a sanya wa wasannin bidiyo na tashin hankali da ake sayarwa a jihar California alama da ke nuna “18” inda ya zamo sayar da su ga kananan yara laifi ne mai jawo hukuncin tarar $1000 a kowane laifi." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Bayan shekaru 250, Guinness ya bunƙasa zuwa wani kasuwancin duniya da ke samun sama da biliyan 10 na euro (US$14.7 biliyan) kowace shekara." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Yesu mai shekaru 21 ya shiga kungiyar Manchester City shekaran da ta gabata a watan Janairu shekara 2017 daga kugiyar Palmeiras na Brazil a kudi £27." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Sau da yawa, dole ne ku sayi lambar duniya daban wanda zai ba wayoyin PSTN damar kiran ku. Inda adadin ya fito yana kawo canji ga mutanen da suke kiranka." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Amir Khan, wanda ya ci lambar azurfa a wasan Olympic 2004 ya ce “A cikin zuciya ta na yi imanin cewa bai kamata mata su yi fada ba. Ra’ayi na kenan”" },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Matsatsen dusan kankara da tsagewa cike ciki da alaman tuta. Za a iya tafiyan da tractors na musamman, hauling sleds da mai da kayayyaki." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Don haka, ya sake nanata abinda ya fada a baya cewa Roe v. Wade ya kasance “doka karbabbiya ar ƙasa”, tare da jaddada mahimmancin rashin kwan gaba kwan baya a hukunce-hukunce kolin koli." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Kashi goma sha takwas na ƴan Venezuela ba su da aiki, kuma mafi yawan waɗanda ke da aiki suna aiki ne a kananan masana’antu." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "An gaskata cewa wannan shine karo na biyar a tarihi da mutane suka ga abin da ya kasance abin da aka tabbatar a sinadarance abubuwan martian ne da ke fadowa zuwa duniya." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Yana iya zama hanya mai kyau na shimfida kasafin kudi domin ba da izini mai zurfi a wani wuri tunda yawancin aika na sa kai na ba da daki da katako da kankanin albashi." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Da dama cikin mazauna Bishkek sun zargi masu zanga-zangar da suka fito daga kudanci da halayyar rashin mutunta doka." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Turkiyyar Turai (wato gabashin Thrace ko Rumelia da ke cikin sashen tsibirin Balkan) ya kunshi kashi 3% ne na ƙasar." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Sun hada da takaita kudi da kuma haramcin da Tarayyar Turai ta yi kan fitar da danyen mai, wanda daga shi ne tattalin arzikin Iran yake karbar kashi 80% na kudaden shigarta na kasashen waje." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Nadal ya sami makuna 88% a wasan wanda ya ci makuna 76 a karo na farko." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Godiya ga haɗe-haɗen kebur na fiber optic a ƙarƙarshin teku zuwa ga Turai da kuma tauraron ɗan Adam mai yawan faɗi, Greenland yana a haɗe sosai kuma 93% a cikin jam'arsa suna da damar ga haɗin yanar-gizo." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Gudun 802.11n na da saurin da ya zarce na wanda ya gabace shi da tsaikon saurin da ya kai 600Mbit/s." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "'Yan sanda a New Zealand sun sami matsalar yin amfani da bindigoginsu na radar masu sauri don gane irin gudun da Mr Reid ya ke yi, lokaci daya da yan sandan suka yi nasarar auna gudun Mr Reid shine lokacin da ya rage gudu zuwa 160km / h." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Wadannan mugayen guguwar suna ɗauke da iska har zuwa 480 km/h (133 m/s; 300 mph)." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "A halin yanzu iskar guguwar Fred na tafiya da saurin da ya kai mil 105 cikin awa guda (165 km/h) inda ta doshi arewa-maso-yamma." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "An yi amfani da jiragen yaƙi masu tafiya a ƙarƙashin ruwa a Yaƙin Duniya na I da Yaƙin Duniya na II. A can baya ba su da sauri kuma ba su iya harbi mai nisa." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Ranan bakwai (7) ga watan Oktoba wani injin ya rabu yayin tashi, babu raunuka. Russia ta dakatar da II-76s na dan lokaci bayan wannan hatsari." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "kashi 34 na wadanda ke cikin jin ra’ayoyin suna da ra’ayi kamar wannan, son Sarauniya Elizabeth II ta zama mai sarauta ta karshe a Australia." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Minista mai rikon kwarya Julia Gillard ta yi ikirarin a lokacin yakin neman zaben shekarar 2010 cewa ya yi imani Australia za ta zama jamhuriya a karshen mulkin Sarauniya Elizabeth II." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "An yi shari’ar ne a Virginia saboda nan ne garin kamfanin AOL mai samar da mashigar yanar gizo, kuma kamfanin da ya shigar da karar." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Jonny Reid, direba ne na kungiyar A1GP New Zealand, a yau dan shekara 48 din ya kafa tarihi na mafi gudu a kan gadar Aukland Harbor Bridge, wanda bai keta doka ba." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Kwamishinan kasuwanci da masana'antu na AU Albert Muchanga ya sanar da cewa Benin za ta shiga." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "A rahoton wata-wata na baya-bayan nan, OPEC ta sanarda cewa yawan ɗanyen man da ake fitarwa ya yi kasa da ganga miliyan 2.8 a rana, faɗuwar da bai taɓa yi ba a shekaru ashirin da suka gabata." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Ranar 24 ga Satumba, 1759, Arthur Guinness ya sanya hannu kan yarjejeniyar hayar shekara 9,000 da kamfanin Barasa na St Jame’s Gate da ke Dublin a kasar Ireland." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Yankin Turkiyya, wanda ya hada da tabkuna, ya mamaye murabba'in murabba'in kilomita 783,562 (300,948 sq mi), wanda murabba'in murabba'in kilomita 755,688 (kilomita 291,773) yana kudu maso yammacin Asiya da kuma murabba'in murabba’in kilomita 23,764 (9,174 sq mi) a Turai." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Tunda mafarinta, Onion ta zama mai yada labaru mai gaskiya, tare da bugu, shafin yanar gizonta ta jawo masu ziyarta har 5,000,000 a watar Oktoba, tallace-tallace na sirri, labaru na tsawon awa 24, podcasts, da kuma kwanan nan ta fara taswirar duniya da ake kira Dumb World." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Guguwar, da ke da nisan kimanin mil 3,000 daga Miami ta Florida, na tare da iska da ke gudun mil 40 a awa guda (64 kph)." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "A Faransa, zaɓe ya kasanace wani abu mai ƙarancin fasahar zamani: masu zaɓe na keɓe kansu a cikin wani akwati, suna saka wata bugaggiyar takarda da ke nuna ɗan takararsu a cikin wata ambulan." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "A tsawon lokaci a karnoni na goma sha tara da ashirin, an yi imanin cewa mazaunan farko na New Zealand su ne mutanen Maori, waɗanda suka yi farautar manya-manyan tsuntsaye da ake kira moas." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "A ƙasashe da dama da ke da irin wannan doka, gidajen otal na yanki ke gudanar da rijistar (don haka tabbata ka tambaya)." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Alamar “kwarin sama” ta yi kama da V sannan “alamar kwarin ƙasa” kamar maɗauri ne ko murabba’i da ya kuskure gefen ƙasan ta." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Daga karshe dai, B&amp;Bs tana gasa ne a abubuwar musamman guda biyu: shimfidas da abincin karya kumallo." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Labari ya bazu a cikin yankin Red Lake a yau yayin jana'izar Jeff Weise kuma da kuma kama mutun uku daga cikin tara cewa an kama wani ɗalibi dangane da harbe-harben makarantar na ranar 21 ga Maris." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Ma'aikatan tafiye-tafiye galibi suna da ma'amala tare da takamaiman otal, kodayake kuna iya samun damar tsara wasu nau'o'in masauki, kamar filayen zangon, ta hanyar wakilin balaguro." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Ofishin jikadancin Amurika da ke Nairobi, Kenya ya bayar da wani gargaɗi cewa “masu tsatsauran ra’ayi daga Somaliya” na shirin ƙaddamar da harin bom na ƙunar-baƙin-wake a Kenya da Ethiopia." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Kodayake kowace ƙasa ta kasance 'Scandinavia', akwai bambance-bambance masu yawa tsakanin mutane, sarakuna, al'adu da tarihin Denmark, Sweden, Norway da Iceland." }
    ],

    // The representative tier. Uniform stride over the same segments; keep it alongside the hard-set.
    "sample": [
        "Kashi goma sha takwas na ƴan Venezuela ba su da aiki, kuma mafi yawan waɗanda ke da aiki suna aiki ne a kananan masana’antu.",
        "Wasu masana kimiyyar sun kawo hujjar cewa waɗannan tsirrai suna ɗauke da guba don haka zai yi wuya a ce kakannin ƙadangare na cin su, koda yake yanzu sloth da sauran dabbobi kamar aku (jikokin kakannin ƙadangare) su kan ci ganyaye ko yayan itace masu guba.",
        "Amir Khan, wanda ya ci lambar azurfa a wasan Olympic 2004 ya ce “A cikin zuciya ta na yi imanin cewa bai kamata mata su yi fada ba. Ra’ayi na kenan”",
        "An fara shirin da karfe 8:30 na yamma (15.00 UTC).",
        "Gilashin kankara ba su da ƙarfi, amma suna gangarowa daga dutsen. Wannan zai haifar da tsagewa, gurabe, wanda gadoji na dusar ƙanƙara ke iya rufe shi.",
        "An sami kwarewar dabbobi masu tafiya da kafafu biyu a ƙasusuwan tarihi na Australopithecus daga shekaru miliyan 4.2-3.9 da suka shude, duk da cewa watakila Sahelanthropus sun yi tafiya da kafafu biyu tun wajen shekaru miliyan bakwai da suka gabata.",
        "Amma, idan wannan ya taɓa faruwa tabbas ba zai faru na dogon lokaci ba. Taurari sun bazu sosai cewa akwai miliyoyin mil tsakanin taurari waɗanda “maƙwabta” ne.",
        "Guguwar Fred ita ce guguwar teku mafi karfi da aka taba gani tun sanda aka fara amfani da tauraron Dan Adam, kuma guguwa ta uku wadda ake da bayananta da ta faru a gabashin 35°W.",
        "Safari na tafiya (wanda ake kira “tafiyar daji”, “safari maiyawo”, ko tafiya “ƙafa”) ya ƙunshi yin yawo, ko dai na awanni ko kwanaki da yawa.",
        "A takaice dai, babu wani abun da za a koya. Koyarwa tana faruwa ne a tsakanin mai koyo da kuma karantarwar da ake yi.",
        "Da yawan tikitin da ake sayarwa a shafukan yanar gizo a irinsu eBay da Craigslist, suna kasancewa wadanda ake maimaita amfani da su ne.",
